// What a new survivor on a multiplayer server starts with (#68): a little, in its pockets.
// Single-player doesn't use it (you wake up in a bedroom with a house to search).
// `item` is an id in items/items.ron; `count` defaults to 1 (1 to 20). At most 12 entries, and
// keep it to what pockets hold (3 litres): the kit is put there without asking whether it fits.
// A server reads this file from its data folder (`--data DIR`); without it, survivors start with
// nothing.
(
    items: [
        (item: "water_bottle"),
        (item: "chocolate_bar"),
        (item: "rag", count: 2),
        (item: "matches"),
    ],
)
